<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/4/eng@/~cl_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after Clause (2) the following Clause: “(2a) A person appointed as Prime Minister under paragraph (2)(a) shall not at any time hold the office of Prime Minister for periods amounting in the aggregate to more than ten years, either continuously or otherwise.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/4/eng@> .
