<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/4/eng@/~cl_2__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "in Clause (5), by inserting after the words “Clause (4)” the words “or Clause (4b)”."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/4/eng@> .
